1
00:00:02,843 --> 00:00:12,963
Glory and honor...

2
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:18,489
From the white towers of Stormwind to the forges in the stone

3
00:00:18,539 --> 00:00:23,874
We were scattered, we were broken, now we will not stand alone

4
00:00:23,924 --> 00:00:29,380
Dwarf and gnome and night elf, human hands upon the hilt

5
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:36,376
Every kingdom that they burned is a kingdom we rebuilt

6
00:00:37,578 --> 00:00:42,993
Hear the bells of Stormwind's keep ring across the vale

7
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:48,339
Blue and gold on every banner where the brave men go

8
00:00:48,389 --> 00:00:54,325
Arathi's fields are waiting and the Basin holds its breath

9
00:00:54,375 --> 00:00:59,350
Our names will outlive us, glory outlives death

10
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,712
Lift the banners, sound the call

11
00:01:01,762 --> 00:01:05,365
Shoulder to shoulder, one and all

12
00:01:06,207 --> 00:01:08,880
Raise the light! Raise the light!

13
00:01:08,930 --> 00:01:11,242
Blue and gold against the night

14
00:01:11,292 --> 00:01:13,324
Stormwind and the kingdoms rise

15
00:01:13,374 --> 00:01:17,577
For glory and honor, light the sky!

16
00:01:21,202 --> 00:01:26,758
Warsong Gulch, the flag returns, the horns are calling home

17
00:01:26,808 --> 00:01:32,083
Every hero in the line has made this land their own

18
00:01:32,133 --> 00:01:37,569
Carve our story into marble, let the ages know our name

19
00:01:37,619 --> 00:01:42,974
We are legends in the making, we are glory, we are flame

20
00:01:43,024 --> 00:01:45,356
Lift the banners, sound the call

21
